### Finance Control API — testes manuais (REST Client / VS Code / Rider)
### Suba a API antes: `dotnet run --launch-profile http`
### Ajuste @userId, @categoryId se necessário após criar usuário/categoria.

@host = http://localhost:5056
@userId = 1
@categoryId = 1
@accountId = 1

### --- Tipos de transação (somente leitura) ---
GET {{host}}/api/TransactionTypes

### --- Contas: listar ---
GET {{host}}/api/Account

### --- Contas: criar ---
POST {{host}}/api/Account
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Conta teste HTTP",
  "initialBalance": 100.00,
  "userId": {{userId}}
}

### --- Contas: obter por id (troque o id) ---
GET {{host}}/api/Account/2

### --- Contas: atualizar ---
PUT {{host}}/api/Account/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": 2,
  "name": "Conta teste HTTP (editada)",
  "initialBalance": 100.00,
  "currentBalance": 150.50
}

### --- Categorias: listar ---
GET {{host}}/api/Category

### --- Categorias: registrar (usa enum numérico: 1=Receita, 2=Despesa) ---
POST {{host}}/api/Category/registerCategory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "Teste API",
  "categoryDescription": "Categoria criada pelo .http",
  "type": 2
}

### --- Categorias: atualizar ---
PUT {{host}}/api/Category/{{categoryId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": {{categoryId}},
  "categoryName": "Teste API (editada)",
  "description": "Descrição atualizada",
  "transactionTypeId": 2
}

### --- Transações: listar (filtro opcional) ---
GET {{host}}/api/Transaction?userId={{userId}}

### --- Transações: criar (status: 1=Pendente, 2=Pago — saldo só muda com Pago) ---
POST {{host}}/api/Transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionDescription": "Compra teste",
  "transactionValue": 25.90,
  "date": "2026-05-04T15:00:00Z",
  "transactionTypeId": 2,
  "categoryId": {{categoryId}},
  "accountId": {{accountId}},
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "status": 2
}

### --- Transações: obter por id (troque @txId) ---
@txId = 1
GET {{host}}/api/Transaction/{{txId}}

### --- Transações: atualizar ---
PUT {{host}}/api/Transaction/{{txId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": {{txId}},
  "transactionDescription": "Compra teste (editada)",
  "transactionValue": 30.00,
  "date": "2026-05-04T16:00:00Z",
  "transactionTypeId": 2,
  "categoryId": {{categoryId}},
  "accountId": {{accountId}},
  "status": 2
}

### --- Transações: excluir ---
DELETE {{host}}/api/Transaction/{{txId}}

### --- Usuários (rota sem prefixo api): listar ---
GET {{host}}/user

### --- Usuários: registrar (senha mín. 8 caracteres) ---
POST {{host}}/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "Tester API",
  "email": "tester.api@example.com",
  "password": "Senha1234!",
  "profilePhoto": ""
}
